# Arch AUR package metadata for openjiuwen-sandbox

These PKGBUILD + systemd unit + sysusers + tmpfiles files are released
under the [0BSD license](https://spdx.org/licenses/0BSD.html), matching
the convention of the AUR repo itself.

The packaged upstream software (openJiuwen sandbox + gateway) is
Apache-2.0 licensed; see `/usr/share/licenses/openjiuwen-sandbox/LICENSE`
after install.